    "Recording break: 0:17:42 «دو چار منٹ بعد اس کو جاری رکھتے ہیں»; resumes 0:17:46 with a recap of shibh-'amd. No «- خلا:» header lines in this transcript. Blank lines after 0:14:52 and 0:29:57 are only line breaks (timestamps continue).",
